{
  "id": 19,
  "description": "Welcome to the Guild!\n\nFeel free to join. This is a casual guild. Please contribute to challenges when you can. Unused accounts will occasionally be kicked to make room for others (leave a note in your bio if you will be away).\n\nHigh level raids at 12pm PDT (GMT-7) on weekdays. \n\nAll stockpile donations welcome. \n\nGood news everyone! Pool Party Fridays are back! Thanks to timely and generous donations from our guild mates we will be firing up the hot tub every friday sometime after our 12:00 pm (PDT) raid. There is often a shooting star on friday that gives the same bonuses as the energizing pool so if at all possible we will wait to energize later in the afternoon but typically it will be activated sometime between 3:00 and 6:00 pm (PDT). Also if the mark budget permits we will try to activate the pool on some days where the T3 shrine is also active and occasionally when shooting stars with magic find bonuses appear. Thanks everyone!\n\nPool Party Fridays, let&#039;s go! (:",
